WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.580
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.840
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.570
It's a Dark Synchro monster!  I'm scared!

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.290
It can use the effects of monsters 
that are in the graveyard.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.810
My turn!

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.860
I summon Infernity Archfiend from my hand!

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:34.100
Infernity Beast attacks Speed Warrior!

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.930
Hell Howling!

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:46.280
Dance the dance of death, Yusei!

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:56.180
This is a real Riding Duel!  It's 
different than your childish games!

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.990
The battle isn't over yet!

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:05.870
Infernity Archfiend attacks Yusei directly!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.820
Hell Pressure!

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.010
Yusei!

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:15.210
Yusei!

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:27.590
Die, Yusei!

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:47.670
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:52.770
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.680
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.450
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:07.810
No matter how bad today is

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:12.800
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.200
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:22.270
Is light it myself

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:27.270
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:32.240
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:38.540
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:42.520
Today will never exist again

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:48.430
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:18.240
Dark Synchro!
Come, Hundred-Eyes Dragon

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.480
Yusei!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.550
Yusei!

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:35.490
I open my trap card Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.580
It negates the attack 
of one of your monsters!

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:49.160
After activation, the card is set again 
instead of going to the graveyard.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:55.350
Yusei…

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.590
I set one card and end my turn.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:20.130
You refuse to die.  You're willing to 
do whatever it takes to stay alive.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.680
You never change, Yusei.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.250
You're wrong.  Kiryu.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:26.740
Back then, I…

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.950
It's your turn.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.060
My turn!

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.830
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:46.860
I can now Special Summon one 
Level 2-or-below monster

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:50.860
from my graveyard on to my field 
in faceup defense position!

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.650
Appear, Speed Warrior!

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:03.780
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Speed Warrior!

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:12.820
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.050
Synchro Summon!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.570
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.630
Keep acting tough.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:31.020
I activate the trap Shard 
of Hope that's on my field.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:34.400
With this Continuous Trap, when my monster

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:38.400
deals you battle damage, I 
draw one card from my deck.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.100
If it's a trap card, I can 
activate it from my hand.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:46.920
That's only if you manage 
to deal me battle damage.

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:50.780
His Continuous Trap is Depth Amulet.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:56.040
By sending one card in his hand to the 
graveyard, he can negate the attack of my monster.

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:59.580
However, he has two cards in his hand.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.110
He also has two monsters on his field.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.320
He has plenty of options to 
keep the cards in his hand.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:12.080
Junk Warrior attacks Infernity Beast!

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.360
Scrap Fist!

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:24.160
I send one card in my hand to the graveyard 
to activate Depth Amulet's effect!

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.350
The battle is negated!

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:37.540
He lessened the number of cards in his 
hand in order to protect his monster.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.100
Thanks for the concern.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.850
I end my turn!

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.200
My turn!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:55.160
I release Infernity Beast and Infernity 
Archfiend to Advance Summon Dark Tuner Nightmare Hand!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.190
It can't be!

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:09.300
In the shadow world, a negative 
Level 5 monster exists.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.500
He summoned a Dark Tuner.  That means…

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:17.510
When Nightmare Hand is 
successfully summoned, I can

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:21.510
Special Summon a Level 2-or-below 
monster from my hand!

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:22.580
What?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.190
I Special Summon Infernity Dwarf!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:38.530
Level 10 Dark Tuner Nightmare Hand 
dark tunes Level 2 Infernity Dwarf!

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:39.690
Just as I feared!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:08:02.420
When absolute darkness descends, 
the eyes of the afterlife open!

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:10.370
Shadows, descend!  Dark Synchro!

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.650
What's coming?

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:16.900
Come, Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:28.680
Level negative 8.  3000 attack points.

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:33.760
Kiryu, so this is your ace monster.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.690
Jack, look at that monster!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.850
Dark Synchro.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:48.960
What's that monster?  Kiryu never 
had that in his deck before.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:09:00.100
Hundred-Eyes Dragon attacks Junk Warrior!

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.550
Yusei!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.980
I open my trap card!  Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.940
Hundred-Eyes Dragon's 
monster effect activates!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:19.370
When this card is faceup, it gains the 
effects of Dark Attribute monsters in my graveyard!

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.280
What?

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:24.190
It gains Infernity Beast's monster 
effect from my graveyard!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:34.790
If I attack when I have zero cards in my 
hand, you can't activate spell or trap cards!

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:38.200
Zero cards in his hand!  That's 
what he was aiming for!

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:45.950
Go, Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:48.560
Infinity Sight Stream!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.020
Crash into the flames, Yusei!

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:08.050
That's the spirit, Yusei!

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:10.350
I won't let you surrender yet!

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:15.310
I'll make you taste even more deadly pain!

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:16.820
Kiryu…

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:19.510
I end my turn.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.540
My turn!

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:31.200
I summon Rockstone Warrior 
in defense position!

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:39.570
You're going to stall using defense monsters.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:42.530
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:48.850
After Depth Amulet is activated, it's destroyed 
during the End Phase of the opponent's third turn.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:54.170
By sending cards in his hand to the graveyard, 
he was able to use that trap to negate battles.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:59.330
However, he no longer needs it because his 
strategy doesn't require having cards in his hand.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.340
The strategy he was using...

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:07.040
Kiryu, it's completely different than before.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:15.970
In fact, everything about you is different.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.080
Thanks to you.

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:22.800
Why?  Why do we have to fight?

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.480
Kiryu…

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.600
Let's get our satisfaction!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.950
I don't need to use cheap tricks!

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:06.430
With our overwhelming power and courage, 
we'll keep pushing to the end!

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:36.520
This is the final area.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:41.230
When we're done, Satisfaction 
will have united Satellite.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:22.720
Come out!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:33.800
That's cheating!  It should be four-on-four!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.980
It's fine.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:40.230
Unless there's this many of 
them, I won't be satisfied.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.300
Duel!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.980
Here I go!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:55.710
Twin-Sword Marauder attacks 
Goblin Attack Force!

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:09.770
You're next!

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.480
Here I go!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.180
Are you the leader?

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:42.940
How dare you!

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.280
You're the ones who gave dueling a bad name!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.820
You'll pay for that!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.100
All I care about is winning the battle.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:57.750
And I can win by physically beating you up!

00:14:57.850 --> 00:14:59.030
What?

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:06.160
Die!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:18.010
Bye, kid.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.580
Yusei!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:23.810
Yusei!

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.000
Kiryu!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.890
Yusei…

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.200
My turn!

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:00.700
I activate the Speed Spell Power Baton.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:05.060
I can activate this Speed Spell when 
I have 6 or more Speed Counters.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:09.640
I select one monster card in my 
deck and send it to the graveyard.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:13.090
During the Damage Step, one 
monster on my field gains

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:17.090
attack points equal to the 
monster I sent to the graveyard!

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:23.260
The monster I'm sending to the graveyard is 
Infernity Destroyer, which has 2300 attack points!

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.250
What?

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:33.240
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
Hundred-Eyes Dragon's attack points become 5300!

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:39.650
Next, Hundred-Eyes Dragon's 
monster effect activates!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:43.420
It gains the monster effect of Infernity 
Dwarf that's in my graveyard.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:48.840
When I have zero cards in my hand, if 
Infernity Dwarf's attack points are greater than

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:53.840
your defending monster's defense points, 
then the difference is dealt to you as damage!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:59.530
This is the power of my 
zero-card handless combo!

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:02.060
Handless combo…

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:06.300
Hundred-Eyes Dragon attacks 
Rockstone Warrior!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.490
Infinity Sight Stream!

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.870
Take 3700 points of damage!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:21.890
I won't let that happen!  Due to Rockstone 
Warrior's monster effect, battle damage becomes zero!

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.950
You barely survived, Yusei.

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:31.380
But is there anything you 
can do on the next turn?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.700
You have no monsters left on 
your field to act as a shield!

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.570
And you only have two cards in your hand!

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:44.430
With those two cards in your hand, can you 
form a strategy to stop my Hundred-Eyes Dragon?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:50.700
Worry and suffer!  Fight to live!

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:51.660
Quit it!

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:56.080
Kiryu, you're…

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.940
You're…

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:00.970
You're not this type of person!

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:19.040
Kiryu, it's fine!  Let go!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:20.180
Or else, you'll also-

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.560
No way!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.890
I will not forsake you!

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:28.930
You're my friend!

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.090
Kiryu…

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.270
I'm not done.

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:41.790
Due to Hundred-Eyes Dragon's 
monster effect, I activate the

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:45.790
monster effect of Infernity 
Destroyer that's in my graveyard!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.470
When I have zero cards 
in my hand, you take 800

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:53.470
points of damage when I destroy 
your monster in battle!

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:14.920
Thank you, Kiryu.

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:46.930
We've conquered Satellite.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.500
We did it!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:49.670
Yeah!

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.150
Of course!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:05.240
Team Satisfaction is the greatest!

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:24.890
You'll burn this time, Yusei Fudo!

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:28.600
Yusei!  Kiryu!

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.080
That's enough, Kiryu!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.370
Yusei!

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.380
Kiryu!

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:38.550
Yusei!

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:46.390
You traitor!

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:58.970
Yusei, you traitor!

00:22:13.190 --> 00:22:17.660
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:22.730
We will build our own future

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:28.170
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:33.350
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:48.490
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:54.060
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:58.770
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:04.040
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:08.510
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:08.710 --> 00:23:14.090
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:18.890
This journey has no end

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:24.430
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:24.860 --> 00:23:29.670
Hear my voice
